part igt_1
  tally 1
  law
  note "IGT-1 · What is taxed: what a person acquires by inheritance or by gift, the person or the asset being in Lenia (.1); the acquirer's groups I, II and III (.2), held as the index igt_group of IGT-3."
  note "No figure. A sum an insurer pays to a named beneficiary is not acquired by inheritance, so it is outside .1 (and exempt from PIT, PIT-14)."

source igt_1 "Inheritance and Gift Tax Act, IGT-1 What is taxed, and the groups (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version igt1_v1
  cite igt_1
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-09-01
  enters 2018-01-01
  note "IGT-1 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-09-01; governs acquisitions from 2018-01-01."
